cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AIFX"
message: >-
  If you use these plugins in research or production, please cite both this
  work and the upstream models the plugins bridge to. See each plugin page
  for the model-specific citations.
type: software
authors:
  - name: MaGMa
    website: "https://www.linkedin.com/company/ma-g-ma/"
abstract: >-
  An open-source suite of OpenFX plugins that bring ComfyUI-hosted AI models
  for depth estimation, surface normals, segmentation, video alpha matting,
  and video super-resolution into any OFX-compatible compositor, editor, or
  color grading tool. Developed for Reepost Studio
  (https://www.reepoststudio.fr/) with funding from CNC.
keywords:
  - openfx
  - ofx
  - vfx
  - comfyui
  - depth-estimation
  - segmentation
  - matting
  - super-resolution
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dev-Reepost/aifx"
url: "https://Dev-Reepost.github.io/aifx/"
